'''Pearlshine''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun that was originally obtainable by purchasing the [[Pearlshine Gamepass]] for 1,699 Robux or the [[Pearls Bundle]] for 3,399 Robux in the [[Summer Event 2024]] or through trading.

==Appearance==
It mainly resembles a pathbringer (much like [[Darkbringer]], [[Dartbringer]] and [[Lightbringer]]). The outer cylinder is a light blue with a purple fading onto it, while the inner cylinder is an electric blue, colored to resemble sea waves. The barrel is replaced by a light blue pearl, while the toggle pin is a light blue, with it's outer structure being almost square. Finally, the grip handle is a dark blue, with X-shaped lighter blue stripes, and the pomnel is light blue.

== Trivia ==
* It partners with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife [[Pearl]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Pearl Set|Pearl Set]].
* This and its partner knife are two of the ten gamepass weapons where you had the option to buy them as part of a bundle or separately, the others being [[Flowerwood]], [[Flowerwood Gun|Flowerwood gun]], [[Darkshot]], [[Darksword]], [[Waves]], [[Ocean]], [[Rainbow (Godly)|Rainbow]], [[Rainbow Gun (Godly)|Rainbow Gun]], [[Sakura]], [[Blossom]], [[Phantom]], [[Spectre]], [[Plasmablade]], [[Plasmabeam]], [[Iceflake]], and [[Icebeam]].
* This and its partner knife are two of the six summer-themed godlies, the others being [[Watergun]], [[Chroma Watergun]], [[Waves]] and [[Ocean]].

